illegal use, sanctions requirements, or Prohibited Competitive Use under
Section 6. For any
other material breach, the Licensor may terminate if the Licensee fails to cure
the breach within ten calendar days after written notice.

Upon termination, the Licensee must stop all Production Use of the Licensed
Code and delete Enterprise License Keys in its possession. Sections concerning
restrictions, ownership, disclaimers, liability, governing law, and any accrued
rights or obligations survive termination.

